      "content": "# Pixel RGB Color Mixer\n\nA small offline browser app that lets you mix a color from red, green, and blue channels.\n\n## Features\n\n- Three sliders (0–255) for Red, Green, and Blue\n- Large live preview swatch showing the current color\n- Hex code readout in uppercase `#RRGGBB` format\n- **Random** button to generate a random color\n- Fully keyboard accessible: Tab to move between controls, arrow keys to adjust sliders\n\n## How to run\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. No server, build step, or network connection is required.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup and structure\n- `styles.css` — visual design and responsive layout\n- `app.js` — slider handling, hex calculation, and random color generation\n\n## Notes\n\n- Values are clamped to the 0–255 range.\n- The layout works from 360px wide and up.\n- All controls have visible hover, focus, and pressed states.",
